    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Dixon Residential Estate Agents are delighted to present No. 53 Hampton Wood Avenue to the Dublin 11 property market.\r\n\r\nThis superb two-bedroom, two-bathroom apartment is ideally suited to first-time buyers, second-time buyers, or investors. The property boasts a bright and spacious open-plan kitchen, living, and dining area, creating a welcoming and versatile space for both everyday living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises two generously proportioned bedrooms, with the principal bedroom benefiting from an en-suite, a contemporary family bathroom, and two additional storage closets.\r\n\r\nNo. 53 enjoys a convenient location close to a range of primary and secondary schools, while Finglas Village, Charlestown Shopping Centre, and Blanchardstown are all within easy reach. Dublin International Airport is approximately a 20-minute drive away, while Dublin City Centre is readily accessible by public transport.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate all that this excellent property has to offer.\r\n\r\n**Disclaimer:** All information provided is given to the best of our knowledge. Every effort has been made to ensure the accuracy of the information contained herein; however, some details may have been provided by the vendor. Dixon Residential Estate Agents accepts no responsibility for any errors or inaccuracies contained in this online advertisement. Prospective purchasers are advised to satisfy themselves as to the accuracy of all information provided and to seek their own professional advice where required."
      },
